      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Spring House in Central Park, renovated in 1999, sits on the National Register of Historic Places and still bubbles with spring water.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
